    <item>
      <title>港股异动丨加息预期升温打压金属，黄金股、铜业股等有色金属齐跌</title>
      <link>https://soulmove.github.io/daily-news-ai/?batch=smart-20261120-125622&amp;cat=finance&amp;event=evt_d74f61643092</link>
